  "notes": "# Rove 0.1.16 beta — macOS Apple Silicon\n\n- Open saved workspaces normally after an upgrade, without a recovery/owner screen blocking the app.\n- Store optional Request drafts in `.rove/drafts/requests/` inside the workspace, tied to each Request and including Base/Case changes and ordinary Request/Case variable edits. You decide whether to copy that folder when sharing a workspace.\n- Skip missing, incomplete, corrupt, unsupported or stale drafts and open the latest saved content. Only explicit Save promises durability.\n- Prevent removed or discarded drafts from returning through old app caches or late writes. Save and Discard remove only their matching checkpoint and preserve newer edits.\n- Keep explicit Discard changes and update, with protection against interrupted updates. Historical recovery copies remain available for deliberate review.\n\nThis beta update targets macOS arm64. This is a required update: the minimum supported version is now 0.1.16; Windows and legacy downloads retain their current versions. macOS signing remains ad hoc without Apple notarization.\n",
